    feat(db): port 34 API routes to Prisma, delete JSON store (Commit C of 3)
    
    Replaces every getDB()/saveDB() call site with direct Prisma queries
    against Supabase. Uses real FK relations (Game.players, Coach.batches,
    Camp.registrations, etc.) where the old code did manual joins over
    arrays-of-records. Counts/aggregates lean on prisma.X.count and
    prisma.X.aggregate; concurrent writes land in $transaction so seat-left
    and booking-status stay consistent.
    
    Deletes src/lib/db.ts and data/db.json — they have no remaining callers.
    All routes compile (tsc --noEmit clean) and `next build` succeeds.
    
    Notable preserved quirks:
    - complete-games/complete/route's reliability formula still looks up
      coach reviews by the *user's* id (old code did the same). Flagged
      for a future fix, kept as-is to avoid behavior drift.
    - user DELETE now soft-deletes (deletedAt) instead of removing the row,
      because Prisma FKs don't allow orphaning gamePlayers/bookings. The
      admin/users view already filtered by deletedAt: null.

